        "Description": "Turtorial: Start as the investment banker and use a sedative object on the to bankers in the corner drinking. The Target will see the bodies if you watch the full cutscene at the start. Kill her before she tells the guards. Now take cover in the corner with your gun out and aim away from your position. Now unaim and you should see Agent 47 clipping a little bit on the wall. Now change your direction the other way and stop covering  quick or you have to restart. Now try to land on other target.",
